{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tour"},{"type":"text","text":" improved by 2-opt to a 2-optimal tour, by JGraphT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TwoOptHeuristicTSP.improveTour"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s procedure: best improvement, the first move (i, j) in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row-major order on ties, until no exchange of two tour edges for two lighter ones remains."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"LEMON’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Opt2Tsp"},{"type":"text","text":" shares the name only: it takes the first improving move and restarts the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scan, which ends at a different tour. The first vertex of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tour"},{"type":"text","text":" stays first. Only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tour.vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" is read: the result uses the lightest edge of each pair, as every tour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does. nil below three vertices."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/graph\/twoopttour(improving:weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/twoOptTour(improving:weight:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"twoOptTour"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"improving"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tour"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"ty